window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A sweeping six-book urban fantasy series that will have you devouring the pages like a bloodlust-fevered vampire drinking from the vein.</b></p> <p><b>An unearthed magical stone that will change the world.</b></p> <p><b>A supernatural secret society prepared to defend it.</b></p> <p><b>And adversaries who want to burn civilization to the ground.</b></p> <p>In a job gone wrong, thief Meredith Stone, discovers the long-lost Pearl of Hell, thereby unleashing a magical awakening felt around the globe.</p> <p>When Tobias, a vampire member of a dark-artifact hunting secret society, finds Meredith, the Pearl is long gone.</p> <p>However, all is not lost.</p> <p>Meredith is more than what she seems: a witch of lore.</p> <p>A seeker.</p> <p><i>And</i> a pain in Tobias’s fangs. A PITF he is charged to protect.</p> <p>The duo is tasked with recovering the Pearl of Hell. The problem? Well, other than the fact that the Pearl of Hell, a legendary <i>lapis caelesti </i>famed for spurring madness and chaos, seems to have vanished into thin air?</p> <p>Tobias is experiencing bloodlust for the first time in over a century. Bloodlust for <i>her.</i></p> <p><i>This series is a complete, progressively spicier urban fantasy series with multiple POVs, three featured M/F romances, deadly enemies, and sky-high stakes. If you like the found family aspect of Vampire Diaries, the slow burn and intense romance of the Fever series, and the action of Supernatural, you’ll love the Coven of Shadows and Secrets Series.</i></p> <p><b>Series Tropes:</b></p> <p>Dark artifact hunters/secret societies</p> <p>Demon hunters</p> <p>Slow burn spicy romance</p> <p>Soulmates</p> <p>Grumpy x Sassy</p> <p>Forbidden love</p> <p>Found family</p> <p>Shifters/vampires/witches/fae/mages</p> <p>7 deadly sins and epic adversaries</p> <p>Series HEAs</p>"; 
